        "536": {"synopsis":"Calls $1BA8 for drive A in the bank its drive table byte gives (CALL_BANK_A_W), with A = the\ndrive (IYh); rc_nodrive ($16) when bit 7 of the byte is set.\nChanges: IYh = the drive.","comment":"IYh = the drive"},
