        "749": {"synopsis":"Gets or sets the default drive (kept at $2007, its complement at $2008).\n1. A = $FF: A = the default drive.\n2. Otherwise DRIVE_CHECK_VEC for drive A with B = 1; when it works the drive becomes the\n   default, else rc_nodrive ($16).\nExit: carry set, A = the default drive; carry clear, A = $16.","comment":"Only asked?"},
        "751": {"comment":"Yes"},
