        "924": {"comment":"Drive in bits 3-0"},
        "925": {"comment":"HL back, as decided"},
        "926": {"comment":"DE back"},
        "928": {"synopsis":"Adds the decimal digit at HL to E: E = E x 10 + the digit, HL past it, carry clear. Carry\nset when (HL) is not a digit.\nChanges: A, D.","comment":"The character"},
        "929": {"comment":"Below '0'?"},
        "932": {"comment":"10"},
        "934": {"comment":"Past '9'?"},
        "937": {"comment":"Past it"},
        "938": {"comment":"E x 10"},
        "940": {"comment":"Plus the digit"},
        "942": {"comment":"Carry clear"},
        "944": {"synopsis":"Finds the lowest free file number (bit 7 set in its file table byte at $2320) from 1 to 15.\nNot called from this ROM.\nExit: carry set, B = the number, HL at its byte; carry clear, A = rc_number ($1D) when none\nis free.","comment":"From 1"},
        "946": {"comment":"The file table"},
