        "1390": {"synopsis":"A buffer for sector A of cluster DEBC on volume IX, without reading the sector:\nCLUSTER_SECTOR, then BUF_ASSIGN. Called from CLUSTER_CLEAR.\nExit: carry set, HL = the buffer, BCDE = the sector; carry clear, A = the code.","comment":"BCDE = the sector"},
