        "2623": {"synopsis":"Device B's block at IX: IX+$10 = B; ROM2_SD_SIZE ($0EE3, NextZXOS ROM 2's SD card size\nroutine) with C = B; on success the B it returns is OR'ed into IX+$10, and the 32-bit field\nat IX+7 = DE:HL less one (the last sector).\nExit: carry set on success; carry clear on failure.","comment":"Device number"},
