        "6052": {"comment":"Failed?"},
        "6053": {"comment":"Header wanted? Write a blank one"},
        "6059": {"synopsis":"Fills the handle record at DE from the search record at IY ($2E50) and its current entry:\n1. The 15 bytes of the directory position copied, the other 30 zeroed; IY = the handle.\n2. +$1B = the first cluster (low word from entry + $1A; high word from + $14 when IX+$13 bit\n   7 is 0, else 0); +$1F = the size (entry + $1C).\n3. +$11, the current cluster = the first.\n4. +$2B = the header buffer address ($2018).\n5. The header bytes copied to that buffer (HEADER_TO_USER).\nExit: Fc=1; Fc=0 when the entry cannot be read.","comment":"HL = search record"},
        "6062": {"comment":"IY = the handle's record"},
