        "6398": {"synopsis":"Writes a new +3DOS header at the start of the file at IY:\n1. The size made 128 at least; position 0 and its sector fetched (SEEK_START_BYTE).\n2. The 128 bytes: the signature PLUS3DOS_SIG; the file's size; its 8 BASIC header bytes,\n   first taken into +$23 from the header buffer if there is one; zeros; the checksum\n   (SUM_127).\n3. The sector written; position 128, past the header; bit 7 of +$0F set.\nExit: Fc=1; Fc=0 A = error.","comment":"Position 127"},
        "6407": {"comment":"Size 128 at least"},
