        "6803": {"synopsis":"Matches the pattern at DE against a name: with NZ the name text at HL ($FF-ended) first,\nthen the 11-byte 8.3 name at BC. In the pattern, '?' is any one character, '*' the rest up\nto the name's last '.' (or all of it); letters match in either case; a name byte outside\n$20-$7E matches only '_'.\nExit: Z match, NZ none.","comment":"Keep 8.3 name and pattern"},
