        "7219": {"synopsis":"DIR_ENTER without a path text (B = 0)."},
        "7221": {"synopsis":"Enters directory HL ($FF-ended) from the search record: '.' stays; any other name is looked\nup (DIR_NAME_FIND) and must be a directory, else error $45 (rc_notdir). With B nonzero the\npath text at BC (its end) gets the 8.3 name and '/' or, for '..', loses its last name. Then\nvector $0127 with B = 5 moves the search record into it.\nExit: Fc=1; Fc=0 A = error.","comment":"'.'?"},
        "7226": {"comment":"Then the end?"},
        "7230": {"comment":"'.': nothing to do"},
        "7232": {"synopsis":"Look the name up."},
        "7234": {"comment":"Find the entry"},
        "7239": {"comment":"rc_notdir"},
        "7241": {"comment":"Not found?"},
        "7242": {"comment":"Not a directory?"},
        "7244": {"comment":"Path text kept?"},
        "7248": {"comment":"Name '..'?"},
        "7262": {"comment":"Back over the text's '/'"},
        "7263": {"synopsis":"Back to the separator before the last name.","comment":"Back one"},
        "7265": {"comment":"Separator?"},
        "7270": {"comment":"or the ':'?"},
        "7274": {"comment":"After the ':'"},
        "7277": {"synopsis":"The found entry's 8.3 name added to the text.","comment":"DE = the text's end"},
        "7279": {"comment":"The entry's 8.3 name"},
        "7282": {"comment":"As NAME.EXT"},
        "7285": {"comment":"BC = after its $FF"},
        "7287": {"comment":"Back on the $FF"},
        "7288": {"synopsis":"A '/' and the end mark.","comment":"'/'"},
        "7291": {"synopsis":"The end mark.","comment":"$FF after it"},
        "7295": {"synopsis":"The search record into the directory found."},
        "7296": {"comment":"B = 5: into the entry's directory"},
        "7298": {"comment":"Vector $0127"},
        "7307": {"synopsis":"Looks up name HL (wildcards allowed) in the search record's directory from its start\n(DIR_FIND_NEXT, no filter), the entry read to $21C0.\nExit: Fc=1 found, A = attributes, Z when it is not a directory; Fc=0 not found or an error."},
        "7308": {"comment":"From the first entry"},
        "7312": {"comment":"Buffer"},
        "7315": {"comment":"Pattern match, no filter"},
        "7321": {"comment":"Not found?"},
        "7322": {"comment":"A = its attributes"},
        "7325": {"comment":"Directory?"},
        "7329": {"synopsis":"Vector $0139: the search record's next used entry (DIR_ENTRY_FIND, long name gathered) to\nthe buffer at DE: +0 attributes; +1 the 11-byte 8.3 name (bytes outside $20-$7E as '_'); +12\ntime, +14 date; +16 size; +20, with B bit 6, the 8 BASIC bytes of a +3DOS header ($FF and 7\nzeros without one); +28 the name text's length with its $FF; +30 the name text (long name,\nor NAME.EXT).\nExit: Fc=1, DE past the record; Fc=0 A = error ($17 rc_nofile at the end).","comment":"IY = $2E50, IX its volume"},
        "7332": {"comment":"Keep buffer and options"},
        "7334": {"comment":"Next entry, long name gathered"},
        "7337": {"comment":"B = options"},
        "7338": {"comment":"C = attributes"},
        "7340": {"comment":"None left?"},
        "7341": {"comment":"Keep options"},
        "7342": {"comment":"+0: attributes"},
