        "7603": {"comment":"Next entry"},
        "7608": {"synopsis":"Vector $0181 (ROM 2's PATH_CALL, DE = $FF00): drive A's current path. B = 0 changes it to\nthe path at HL; B = 1 writes it to the buffer at HL, $FF-ended; other B go to $3D01 in\nDivMMC RAM. These are IDE_PATH's rc_path_change (0) and rc_path_get (1). The work ($1DB3)\nruns through $040D in the RAM bank that the drive's table byte ($0204) names.\nExit: Fc=1; Fc=0 A = error.","comment":"Keep the drive in IYH"},
        "7610": {"comment":"A = the drive's table byte"},
        "7613": {"comment":"Call $1DB3 in that RAM bank"},
        "7619": {"synopsis":"PATH_OP's work: B = 0 change, 1 get, others at $3D01.","comment":"B = 0?"},
        "7623": {"comment":"Not 1: in DivMMC RAM"},
        "7627": {"comment":"Keep the buffer"},
        "7628": {"comment":"HL = the path text"},
        "7631": {"comment":"DE = buffer"},
        "7632": {"synopsis":"One byte, the $FF too."},
        "7635": {"comment":"The $FF?"},
        "7638": {"comment":"Success"},
        "7640": {"synopsis":"Change: the path resolved, its text stored for the drive (DRV_PATH_SAVE), the search record\nmade the drive's current directory (vector $0127, B = 2).","comment":"Keep the drive"},
        "7641": {"comment":"Resolve the path"},
        "7644": {"comment":"D = drive"},
        "7645": {"comment":"Failed?"},
        "7648": {"comment":"Store the text"},
        "7652": {"comment":"Drive number"},
        "7654": {"comment":"B = 2: search record made current"},
        "7664": {"synopsis":"Resolves path HL on drive A from its current path text (DRV_PATH_LOAD to the buffer DE + 2),\nkeeping that text up to date (PATH_WALK_TEXT); a last name is entered as a directory too.\nExit: Fc=1, HL = the new path text; Fc=0 A = error.","comment":"Keep the path and the drive"},
        "7666": {"comment":"Current path text at DE + 2"},
        "7670": {"comment":"HL = path; the text kept"},
